{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RLsiX4cbrK1795151847.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平在深圳會見多國領導人。</p><p></p><p>APEC領導人非正式會議昨日結束，多國領導人仍未離開。</p><p></p><p>習近平上午在深圳麒麟山莊會見澳洲總理阿爾巴內塞。習近平就中澳關係提出四點意見，包括增進彼此互信、深化互利合作、促進兩國友好、加強多邊協作，並將2027年設為「中澳旅遊年」，鼓勵兩國地方、民間等展開更多交流。</p><p></p><p>習近平還會見印尼總統普拉博沃、新加坡總理黃循財、馬來西亞總理安華，及泰國總理阿努廷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:04:02.734093+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:37:11.944726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:21.882507+00:00","content_hash":"511bd59c61d2c4665e3f6a423e57391ed8b2f122ee850164375a49ee366ff0d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:04:02.734093+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}